  "description": "While biking with children is now becoming more common in US cities, starting early is the key to teaching your little ones the joys of riding a bike. We designed the Sprout Mini kids' balance bike to be the first bike for the next generation of urban citizens.\nThe balance bike design is a smart way to get kids started on bikes, that's much more intuitive for little ones than the rattling training wheels we grew up with. \"Less is more\" is Public's design ethos, and by eliminating the pedals and chain, kids can use their natural instincts to balance with their feet and easily scoot around without fear of falling.\nUnlike traditional balance bikes, the Sprout Mini now features lightweight, airless tires that will never go flat, allowing for use on and off the road without a worry. Your little one can zip around just as smoothly as a pedal bike does. Just like you'd expect on a PUBLIC bike, the Sprout Mini features a low-entry design and allows for a wide range of seat and handlebar height adjustments to grow with kids starting from age 2. Kids love them, they look great, and they're tons of fun.\nYou'll receive a 99% assembled bike delivered to your door with simple instructions and the few tools needed to complete the finishing steps.",
